{"unit_id":"caoyiwei850__dsh-client-ui-skins#feature-1","repo":"caoyiwei850/dsh-client-ui-skins","commit":"f4bc4ef36a04751aca7404d7c0e3275dea31764f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-skins 的功能「内置主题」：在 DSH 通用设置的皮肤栏选择四套配色主题，或选择默认外观。主题跟随明暗外观切换。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:429-466","lib/client.js:951-987","lib/client.js:1502-1511"]}
{"unit_id":"caoyiwei850__dsh-client-ui-skins#feature-2","repo":"caoyiwei850/dsh-client-ui-skins","commit":"f4bc4ef36a04751aca7404d7c0e3275dea31764f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-skins 的功能「图片壁纸」：在自定义皮肤中选择 PNG、JPEG 或 WebP 图片，插件采样图片颜色生成配色，并将压缩后的 WebP 图片用于界面背景。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:497-622","lib/client.js:984-1048"]}
